# Peticiones de ejemplo para la extensión "REST Client" de VS Code (humao.rest-client).
# 1) Crea un proyecto en http://localhost:8000/dashboard  2) pega aquí sus claves  3) pulsa "Send Request".

@url = http://localhost:8000
@anon = PEGA_AQUI_LA_CLAVE_ANON
@service = PEGA_AQUI_LA_CLAVE_SERVICE_ROLE

### Salud del servicio
GET {{url}}/health

### Registrar usuario
POST {{url}}/auth/v1/signup
apikey: {{anon}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@example.com", "password": "password123", "data": { "nombre": "Ana" } }

### Iniciar sesión (copia el access_token en @token)
# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/v1/login
apikey: {{anon}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@example.com", "password": "password123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Crear tabla (SQL runner, solo service_role). Una sentencia por petición.
POST {{url}}/rest/v1/_sql
apikey: {{service}}
Authorization: Bearer {{service}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "CREATE TABLE tareas (id serial PRIMARY KEY, owner uuid DEFAULT auth.uid(), titulo text NOT NULL, hecha boolean DEFAULT false)" }

### Activar RLS
POST {{url}}/rest/v1/_sql
apikey: {{service}}
Authorization: Bearer {{service}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "ALTER TABLE tareas ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY" }

### Política: cada usuario solo ve y modifica sus filas (no uses "TO authenticated": usa auth.uid())
POST {{url}}/rest/v1/_sql
apikey: {{service}}
Authorization: Bearer {{service}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "CREATE POLICY propias ON tareas USING (owner = auth.uid()) WITH CHECK (owner = auth.uid())" }

### Insertar como usuario
POST {{url}}/rest/v1/tareas
apikey: {{anon}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "titulo": "Aprender baas_platform" }

### Leer con filtros, orden y paginación
GET {{url}}/rest/v1/tareas?hecha=eq.false&order=id.desc&limit=10&select=id,titulo
apikey: {{anon}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Prefer: count=exact

### Actualizar (requiere filtro)
PATCH {{url}}/rest/v1/tareas?id=eq.1
apikey: {{anon}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hecha": true }

### Activar realtime en la tabla
POST {{url}}/realtime/v1/enable/tareas
apikey: {{service}}
Authorization: Bearer {{service}}

### Crear bucket
POST {{url}}/storage/v1/bucket
apikey: {{service}}
Authorization: Bearer {{service}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "avatares", "public": true }

### Desplegar una función Python
PUT {{url}}/functions/v1/saludar
apikey: {{service}}
Authorization: Bearer {{service}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "def handler(event):\n    nombre = (event.get('body') or {}).get('nombre', 'mundo')\n    return {'mensaje': f'Hola, {nombre}!'}\n" }

### Invocar la función
POST {{url}}/functions/v1/saludar
apikey: {{service}}
Authorization: Bearer {{service}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Ana" }

### Registrar un webhook para cambios en la tabla
POST {{url}}/webhooks/v1
apikey: {{service}}
Authorization: Bearer {{service}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://webhook.site/TU-ID", "events": ["tareas:INSERT"] }
